---
import Article from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { site, publisher, disclosure } from '../site.config';
---
<Article
  title="About Bolivia Unpacked"
  description="What Bolivia Unpacked is, who publishes it, how posts are written and sourced, and how we point readers to verified local operators."
  path="/about/"
  published={site.launchDate}
  reviewed="2026-11-11"
  kicker="About"
  lede={site.positioning}
  pageType="AboutPage"
>
  <h2>What this blog is</h2>
  <p>{site.name} is a travel blog for people planning a trip to Bolivia. Each post starts with a place or a moment on the road and then gets practical: when to go, how to pace the altitude, how long things take, and what to ask before you book.</p>
  <h2>Published by Tourground</h2>
  <p>{site.name} is published by <a href={publisher.url}>Tourground</a>, a directory and booking platform for tour operators and travel agencies. {site.editorLine} Read the full <a href="/disclosure/">disclosure</a>.</p>
  <h2>How we write</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Sourced.</strong> Facts are linked to their source, and each post lists its sources at the end. We prefer official sources: government travel advice, health services, UNESCO and Bolivia’s own institutions.</li>
    <li><strong>Dated.</strong> Every post shows when it was published and last updated. Health, entry and safety details link to the official source and show the date we last checked them.</li>
    <li><strong>Nothing invented.</strong> We do not publish made-up reviews, quotes, prices or statistics. If we cannot source something, we leave it out.</li>
    <li><strong>Honest bylines.</strong> Posts are credited to the Bolivia Unpacked desk. See <a href="/authors/">authors</a>.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Plan this trip</h2>
  <p>Every post ends by pointing you to a verified local operator through the Tourground directory, often Altiplano Journeys. Altiplano Journeys is owned by Tourground’s founders, and it is labelled “{disclosure.founderOwnedLabel}” wherever we recommend it.</p>
  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>{disclosure.paidExplainer} They are labelled “{disclosure.paidLabel}”. There are none on the site at the moment.</p>
  <h2>Photographs</h2>
  <p>Our photographs are freely licensed images from Wikimedia Commons, credited under each photo and on the <a href="/photo-credits/">photo credits</a> page. We do not use AI-generated images or photos of identifiable people.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. To report a mistake, see <a href="/corrections/">corrections</a>.</p>
  <p><strong>{disclosure.footerPublishedBy}</strong></p>
</Article>
